Claude Desktop macOS Chinese Companion

Translation data source:
https://github.com/ICERainbow666/claude-desktop-zh-cn

Special thanks to ICERainbow666 and the claude-desktop-zh-cn community for
maintaining the Simplified Chinese translation files used to build the local
dictionary.

This repository independently implements a separate offline, Accessibility-
only macOS companion. It never deploys resources to, copies, re-signs, backs
up, restores, or otherwise writes files inside Claude.app. It does not
redistribute Claude Desktop and is not affiliated with Anthropic.
